{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13215170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13215170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321517001:0":{"text":"여기 말하는 거지, 갈리?","source_cn":"你说的是这个位置吗，伽利？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB088CFF0A0A498E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321517002:0":{"text":"맞아, 바로 거기야! 역시 우린 잘 맞는다니까!","source_cn":"没错，就是那里！咱们还是一如既往地有默契！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC87E4896A3EAE873","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321517003:1":{"text":"좋아, 그럼 그 수상한 사람들을 찾아봐. 난 여기서 기다릴게.","source_cn":"好吧，你们快去找那些可疑的家伙吧。我在这里等你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEE46A0B1308291F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321517004:0":{"text":"걱정 마세요, 금방 돌아올게요!","source_cn":"放心吧，我们很快就回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07BDD6F156ABA1BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321517005:0":{"text":"저도 미리 사람들을 배치해 준비하고 있겠습니다. 염려 마십시오.","source_cn":"我也会带人提前守好这里，不用担心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62D4E0C150752E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321517006:0":{"text":"아, 맞다, 멜리사! 주변의 흙을 삽으로 조금 파서 발굴 흔적처럼 보이게 만들고, 땅 위에 작은 물건 몇 개를 놓아두는 것도 좋아. 지난번 학회에서 보낸 모형을 쓰면 될 거야...","source_cn":"哦，对了！梅丽莎，记得要用铲子松一松周围的土，制造出被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC9FB5C34EB0E91B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321517007:0":{"text":"알아, 알아. 다~알아서 할게. 내가 고고학을 처음 하는 것도 아니고...!","source_cn":"知道了知道了，不用交代这么多，我又不是第一次考古……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AF33276CCA32914","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321517008:0":{"text":"휴, 너랑 같이 일하는 게 행운인지 불행인지...","source_cn":"唉，真不知道和你搭档是我的幸运还是我的不幸……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BC69DAC109A79A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"멜리사","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伽利":{"text":"갈리","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:公国卫队长":{"text":"공국 근위대 대장","source":"公国卫队长","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":4}}